    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Contact: Dermot Lynch, Auctioneer | 087 262 2382\r\n\r\nDan Howard & Co. Ltd. | \r\n\r\n20 Mercier Park, Curragh Road, Turners Cross, Cork City\r\n2 Bedroom Semi-Detached Bungalow | For Sale\r\nAsking Price: €275,000\r\nDan Howard & Co. are delighted to present No. 20 Mercier Park to the market — a 2 bedroom semi-detached bungalow occupying a most desirable position in one of Cork City's most sought-after residential areas.\r\nThis property offers tremendous potential and represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors to put their own stamp on a home in a prime location. While in need of modernisation and decoration throughout, the bungalow benefits from generously proportioned accommodation, including a valuable attic conversion providing an additional room and shower room.\r\nTurners Cross is renowned for its strong sense of community and superb amenities, with everything you need right on the doorstep. The property enjoys excellent access to the South Link Road, placing the entire city, the South Ring, and beyond within easy reach.\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the potential on offer. \r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\n Close to a host of well-regarded schools\r\n\r\n Local shops, services, and amenities nearby\r\n\r\n Minutes from Turners Cross Stadium\r\n\r\n Quick access to the South Link Road and South Ring\r\n\r\n Within easy reach of Cork City Centre\r\nBER: F\r\n\r\nDan Howard & Co. Ltd.\r\n\r\nAuctioneers, Valuers & Estate Agents\r\n\r\n46 South Mall, Cork\r\n\r\n Office: 021 424 8654 |  Mobile: 0872622328\r\n\r\n\r\nPSRA Licence No. 003581\r\nExperience Matters!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nHallway: 5.1m x 1.1m\r\nSitting Room: 6.66m x 3.14m\r\nKitchen/Dining: 8.5m x 3.4m\r\nBedroom 1: 3.58m x 3.74m\r\nBedroom 2: 3.11m x 2.91m\r\nShower Room: 1.65m x 1.5m\r\n\r\nAttic Conversion\r\n\r\nAttic Room: 3.8m x 2.3m\r\nShower Room: 2.33m x 1.86m"
      },
